  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="5fff359e-2a67-5aeb-afb0-1f78d52dfa68" activityNameId="c52d836a-d0f2-5822-96f7-7419ef6016b2" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Diesel, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Diesel, at regional storage
Inventory for the distribution of petroleum product to the final consumer (household, car, power plant, etc.) including all necessary transports. Shares of domestic production and imports calculated based on statistical data from the Swiss Petroleum Association (Erdölvereinigung) for 2016. Transport efforts estimated based on the transport distances and the means of transport for the relevant countries of origin.;
UUID: e2f4d08e-3132-3502-ac46-89f6ad6b3b77
Transportation of product from the refinery to the end user. Operation of storage tanks and petrol stations. Emissions from evaporation and treatment of effluents. Excluding emissions from car-washing at petrol stations.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Distribution of petroleum products.
Time period: Most information for the year 2000. Split up of NMVOC emissions published 1989.
Production volume: 1.3 million t in 2000.
Sampling: Environmental reports and literature. 
Extrapolations: From single companies to average data.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e2f4d08e-3132-3502-ac46-89f6ad6b3b77.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
